omp-target-team-arrays-gpu.test's program at -O0, whose GPUs' code the
linker wrapper compiles at -O0 as -O asks. AMDGPU's code generation fails on
it, at -O0 and -O1, with "failed to annotate CFG" on a musttail call in
divergent control flow (design document, Driver, LLVM bugs to report).
Expected to fail until LLVM is fixed: when it passes, move this run back
into omp-target-team-arrays-gpu.test.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu
XFAIL: *

RUN: merkc -O0 -fopenmp --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/omp-target-team-arrays.m -o %t0
RUN: %libomp-env OMP_TARGET_OFFLOAD=MANDATORY %t0 \
RUN:   | FileCheck %S/omp-target-team-arrays.m --check-prefix=OUTPUT --match-full-lines --strict-whitespace
